  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building Uganda Energy Credit Capitalisation Company (UECCC) in Livelihood Restoration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The tendering phase for the hydropower ORIO project in Uganda has started and is expected to be completed by the end of 2017 or early 2018. During this time, it is suggested that the International Financial Corporation (IFC) PS5 and livelihood resettlement expert:&#x2022;	Assists in the procurement process by checking the quality of the procurement documents and whether livelihood restoration is adequately included and assisting UECCC in selecting the best RAP consultant. &#x2022;	Trains UECCC (on the job) in livelihood restoration and all related aspects, as well as how to deal with the challenges related to livelihood restoration and shares best practices.</narrative>
  </description>
